<DocsExample TExample="ListDetailViewBasicExample" Title="List and detail" Description="NTListDetailView shows a list beside a detail pane when its container is wide enough, and one pane at a time when narrow. Items carry data-nt-list-detail-trigger and each detail panel a matching data-nt-list-detail-panel; the browser script wires selection. The view fills the height of its parent, so it sits in a fixed-height box here." />
<DocsExample TExample="ListDetailViewSinglePaneExample" Title="Single pane with a back button" Description="Mode=SinglePane shows only the list until an item is selected, then replaces it with the detail. An element with data-nt-list-detail-back, placed in DetailHeader, returns to the list." />
